.git
# Patterns only match at the context root unless they start with **/, so the
# nested venvs, node_modules and .env files under remy/* need the **/ form.
**/.venv
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
**/.pytest_cache
**/.mypy_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/.coverage*
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/.env*
!**/.env.example
**/*.log
**/target
**/dbt_packages
**/logs
**/.DS_Store
